// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AmyStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1933023003" "Amy's story"
// DetailString :
"P3430783840" "When you rescued Amy from the Red Caps, she told you: <br><br>'Thank you, kind Heroes. The Red Caps have held me captive for many months. They have been practicing some spell on me, to drain my strength, and I have just barely managed to hold on. I suspect they have darker plans in mind. To cause suffering is more than enough motive for these creatures, but they often have long term goals."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RedCapPlot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P200179939" "The Red Caps' plot"
// DetailString :
"P68139476" "When you defeated Wormtail, he smirked: <br><br>'It's the end for your witchy friends, {HeroName}! Katie be ours! When we have her soul, Cabal lose everything. All hope, all happiness! We take their last child!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1196381541" "A Tangled Plot"
// DetailString :
"P1818302173" "It began with a test. You had learned from Buck Salinger that the Cabal's plot to get rid of the Red Caps would eliminate all magic life. The youngest Cabalist, Katie, offered to stay their hand, but only if you could prove your worth to their leader, Mary MacComber. You faced her valiantly in battle and earned the trust of the Cabal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3155632137" "It began with a test. You had learned from Buck Salinger that the Cabal's plot to get rid of the Red Caps would instead eliminate all magic life. The youngest Cabalist, Katie, offered to stay their hand, but only if you could prove your worth to their leader, Mary MacComber. You faced her valiantly in battle and earned the trust of the Cabal. <br><br>Katie next asked you to save one of her friends, a sorceress named Amy who had been captured by the Red Caps. You went to Amy's rescue and learned that she had been the victim of a Red Cap ceremony that was draining her strength. She suspected the creatures had even darker plans in mind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeThreeClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P574240376" "It began with a test. You had learned from Buck Salinger that the Cabal's plot to get rid of the Red Caps would instead eliminate all magic life. The youngest Cabalist, Katie, offered to stay their hand, but only if you could prove your worth to their leader, Mary MacComber. You faced her valiantly in battle and earned the trust of the Cabal. <br><br>Katie next asked you to save one of her friends, a sorceress named Amy who had been captured by the Red Caps. You went to Amy's rescue, and learned that she had been the victim of a Red Cap ceremony that was draining her strength. She suspected the creatures had even darker plans in mind. <br><br>Those plans manifested when the Red Caps invaded Katie's home. You expelled them, but learned that they were working a spell to trap Katie's soul!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3502918686" "Hi!  I guess you know by now that we sorceresses have been fighting with the Red Caps for a long time.  A long, long time.  Ever since they came to our settlement in Roanoke, back in 1588. That was shortly after the Fir Bolg came to our lands. They were running away from their enemies in Ireland, the Tuatha de Dannan. We formed a cautious friendship, but we had no idea that the Red Caps had followed them all the way across the sea! <br><br>They trapped us here, killed all the men, and watched our suffering for the last four hundred years! And we finally found a way to get rid of them! <br><br>But if you really think the spell we're going to use may hurt other magic life, you might be able to convince our leader to change her plans. Of course, it won't be easy. My elders have had several centuries to harden their hearts against outsiders. <br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can defeat our leader, Mary MacComber, we'll listen to what you have to say.</A> Otherwise, we'll go ahead with our plan."
// AcceptString :
"P1434196856" "Defeat Mary MacComber"
// SendOffString :
"P159292039" "Mary will really test you, {HeroName}. I think she'll surprise you quite a bit.<br><br>If you can survive long enough, you'll show Mary you're a force to be reckoned with. If you manage to survive the entire ordeal, we'll have something special for you."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2569751977" "Mary still wants to see you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2668144163" "You feel a wise presence watching over you as you step into the spirit realm."

