// Dialog :
"P1500192565" "You defeated Mary MacComber for good!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1311845534" "Great job, {TaskForceName}!  You must really be warriors of renown!  Mary's decided we can trust you.  Of course, there will always be some women who are blinded by hate; not all of us will be on your side.  But enough will.  Especially since I am!  I'm the youngest of the Cabal, and I guess you could say I'm kind of important to the rest of them.  Like a symbol of hope, you know?  Anyway, I can't guarantee everyone will be nice to you, but I can promise we will cease work on our spell.  In return, perhaps you'd be willing to aid us against the Red Caps."
// RandomFameString :
"P3222902278" "I heard {TaskForceName} defeated Mary MacComber ten times!"

