"P3301335888" "You've earned Mary's trust and now there's a task she'd like your help with. One of our most powerful sorceresses has been captured by the Red Caps. Her name's Amy. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you could free Amy from the Red Caps, it would go a long way toward improving your reputation with the Cabal.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1030300490" "Free Amy from the Red Caps"
