// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3100562899" "According to Amy, the Red Caps are trying something really nasty. I don't know what it is yet, but I was just told that they've invaded my house! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you could get down there and get rid of the Red Caps for me, I'd sure appreciate it.</A> Maybe you'll learn something while you're there."
// AcceptString :
"P2507772652" "Get rid of the Red Caps"
// SendOffString :
"P3999292550" "I hope you hurry back. I've been feeling real tired lately and I just can't take the stress."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3935606621" "Defeat all Red Caps"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2344888086" "I heard those Red Caps are still in my house!"

