// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Wormtail 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4285767395" "Wormtail smirked: 'It's the end for your witchy friends, {HeroName}! Katie be ours!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P834896328" "You removed the Red Caps from Katie's home, but learned something terrible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1723755816" "So that's why I've been so tired lately? The Red Caps are sucking out my soul? That's terrible! And not just for me. {HeroName}, I am the very last of the Cabal. If something happens to me, well, it'll take all hope away from my friends and aunties. There's no telling what they'll do if the Red Caps succeed."
// RandomFameString :
"P3636706498" "{TaskForceName} isn't afraid of the Red Caps!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2888849503" "Listen closely, {HeroName}, because I don't have much strength left. I believe the Red Caps have taken almost all of my soul. And I need you to free it. Go to the Grim Vale, where the Red Caps have battled my people all these centuries. I am certain that my soul is trapped there, in the spirit realm. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>My people will help you in your quest, but I believe only you have the strength to set me free.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1433414340" "Free Katie's soul"
// SendOffString :
"P3487103349" "Thank you, {HeroName}. I'll try to hang on."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1652009468" "Please, help me! I don't believe I have much time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3900564792" "A thunderous growl echoes across the vale."

